{"title": "Multiattack (Raphael, tactician)", "pageid": 50277, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack_(Raphael,_tactician)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Sources of Slashing damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Multiattack (disambiguation)\">Multiattack (disambiguation)</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Raphael)\" title=\"Multiattack (Raphael)\">Multiattack (Raphael)</a>      </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp/300px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp, /w/images/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp/300px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Multiattack</b> is an action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty and above, while he is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"ascended\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ascended_Fiend_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ascended_Fiend_(Condition)\" title=\"Ascended Fiend (Condition)\">ascended</a>. It allows him to attack multiple times and grants him Action Surge.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Aim multiple attacks at a target. \n</p>\nOnce per turn, thanks to his cacodemonic power, Multiattack grants Rapharel <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Action_Surge_(Condition)\" title=\"Action Surge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6f/Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action Surge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6f/Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6f/Action_Surge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Action_Surge_(Condition)\" title=\"Action Surge (Condition)\">Action Surge</a>, allowing him to Multiattack again.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 6~72 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:12px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:2;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/D12_Physical.png/29px-D12_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/D12_Physical.png/43px-D12_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/D12_Physical.png/58px-D12_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/D12_Physical.png/29px-D12_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/D12_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/D12_Physical.png/29px-D12_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/D12_Physical.png/43px-D12_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/D